      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Wellfound (AngelList) Hiring Startups, Equity Ranges & Founder Lead Miner\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nExtract fast-growing startups actively hiring on Wellfound along with salary/equity bands and founding team contacts.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/wellfound-angellist-startup-jobs-founders-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/wellfound-angellist-startup-jobs-founders-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Wellfound (AngelList) Startup Jobs Scraper** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "c8e32578-c0ba-41ea-a5bc-2d93780f4680",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Wellfound (AngelList) Startup Jobs Scraper** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "3ab80b60-5de7-4ba6-ad66-5cbacb29fd4a",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
